WEBVTT

00:03:27.472 --> 00:03:30.458
So you're going to be in charge,
you're going to be in control,

00:03:30.482 --> 00:03:32.844
you're going to be in the driver's seat.

00:03:32.868 --> 00:03:36.021
You folks, I'm going to show you
these two teas,

00:03:36.045 --> 00:03:37.672
but you don't have a choice.

00:03:38.141 --> 00:03:40.200
I'm going to give you
one of these two teas,

00:03:40.224 --> 00:03:42.922
and keep in mind, I'm going
to pick one of these two teas

00:03:42.946 --> 00:03:44.341
at random for you.

00:03:44.365 --> 00:03:45.647
And you know that.

00:03:46.215 --> 00:03:49.013
So if you think about it,
this is an extreme-case scenario,

00:03:49.037 --> 00:03:50.323
because in the real world,

00:03:50.347 --> 00:03:52.344
whenever you are taking passenger's seat,

00:03:52.368 --> 00:03:54.964
very often the driver is going
to be someone you trust,

00:03:54.988 --> 00:03:56.211
an expert, etc.

00:03:56.235 --> 00:03:58.068
So this is an extreme-case scenario.

00:03:59.059 --> 00:04:03.996
Now, you're all going to consume the tea.